users/hanshasselberg","html_url":"https://github.com/hanshasselberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2018-01-22T14:46:38Z","updated_at":"2020-02-27T11:19:11Z","closed_at":"2020-02-27T11:19:11Z","assignee":{"login":"hanshasselberg","id":38218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg","html_url":"https://github.com/hanshasselberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I've noticed that occasionally some unit tests of [dqlite](https://github.com/CanonicalLtd/dqlite) hang forever.\r\n\r\nI **believe** that the reason is a potential deadlock between Raft.Shutdown() and the Raft.runSnapshots() goroutine. The timeline of events looks roughly like:\r\n\r\n1. The user calls Raft.Shutdown().Error()\r\n2. Roughly at the same time runSnapshots() decides that it's time to kick Raft.takeSnapshot()\r\n3. The Raft.takeSnapshot() method manages to run a bit and then block on [configReq.Error()](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/blob/master/snapshot.go#L155) call. This can happen if the shutdown signal is being dispatched to the shutdownCh but it's not quite done, and also the call to ```r.configurationsCh <- configReq``` at line 151 succeeded (because configurationsCh is buffered with size 8), but the future was not actually processed by the main raft goroutine (either runLeader, runCandidate or runFollower)\r\n3. The main goroutine of Raft (either runLeader, runCandidate or runFollower) receives the shutdown signal and exits **without** actually processing the pending request in configurationsCh, hence leaving takeSnapshot blocked.\r\n4. The Error() method of future returned by Raft.Shutdown() is blocked waiting for all raft goroutines to finish, but runSnapshots will never return because it's blocked on takeSnapshot() which is in turn blocked on configReq.Error().\r\n\r\nHope this makes sense.\r\n\r\nTo see an example of a unit test that failed as above, look [here](https://travis-ci.org/CanonicalLtd/dqlite/builds/331818891#L539).\r\n\r\nI'm pasting the relevant Go traceback below as well for reference.","closed_by":{"login":"hanshasselberg","id":38218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg","html_url":"https://github.com/hanshasselberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanshasselberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/raft/issues/268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/raft/issues/268/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}